Z||000006||DecadenceR||07-16-2001||09:56 PM||||Well I had the wheel off, and it's not coming from the brake area. Actually, not coming from anywhere in the wheel well at all. but it's coming from right near the wheel well, on the motor side. There's oil getting on the belt, the frame, and even splashing onto the e-brake cable. It loks like it may be coming from the pushrod cover, but it's definitely not coming from the valve cover. I dunno. I'm perplexed.||||reg||1
